class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:966a0749-ac05-4398-9080-998fd50665ed\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:966a0749-ac05-4398-9080-998fd50665ed\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/38px-Ico_stats.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png 2x\"><img alt=\"￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-9c67762bf99aad74END_WIDGET ￼START_WIDGET&quot;'-7eb2815222216314END_WIDGET\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/3/3c/Ico_stats.png/25px-Ico_stats.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/3/3c/Ico_stats.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllDead</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">365521bd-e2bd-4eea-b19a-9d599e0e855d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:365521bd-e2bd-4eea-b19a-9d599e0e855d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:365521bd-e2bd-4eea-b19a-9d599e0e855d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div>   \n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>\n    <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>Left by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/38px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/50px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ulder Ravengard\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png/25px-Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/d/d9/Portrait_Ulder_Ravengard.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ulder_Ravengard\" title=\"Ulder Ravengard\">Ulder Ravengard</a> in camp if <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/38px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/50px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wyll\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png/25px-Portrait_Wyll.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/6d/Portrait_Wyll.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> leaves or is killed permanently</li></ul>\n</div>  <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Text\"> Text </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-book-text\">\n<dl><dd><i>If <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">Wyll</a> left the party alive</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllAlive</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllAlive\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllAlive\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">0c07c8d3-3b26-44ad-bd04-22d85e6b936a</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0c07c8d3-3b26-44ad-bd04-22d85e6b936a\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:0c07c8d3-3b26-44ad-bd04-22d85e6b936a\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><br>\nMy friend, my confidante, my rescuer:\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>None of us lives a life without regret, and mine is no exception. I thought I'd lost my <a href=\"/wiki/Wyll\" title=\"Wyll\">son</a> to a <a href=\"/wiki/Mizora\" title=\"Mizora\">devil</a> - but it was my own hubris that drove him away. And then, a miracle: you brought him back to me. And for that, you have my eternal thanks.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>It's with a heavy heart, then, that I bid you farewell. Wyll has chosen a new path, and I mean to follow. What our futures hold, I can't say - the <a href=\"/wiki/Absolute\" title=\"Absolute\">Absolute's</a> parasites are still lodged in our heads, after all. But I will approach my destiny with my son at my side.\n</p><p><br>\n</p><p>Regards,\n</p><p><br>\nUlder Ravengard, Grand Duke of Baldur's Gate\n</p><p><br>\n</p>\n<dl><dd><i>If Wyll was killed</i> (<details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllDead</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllDead\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:S_ORI_Wyll_WyllLeavesTeam_RavengardLetterWyllDead\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span> / <details class=\"bg3wiki-uid\">\n<summary>UUID</summary>\n<code class=\"bg3wiki-uid-box\">365521bd-e2bd-4eea-b19a-9d599e0e855d</code>\n</details> <span class=\"bg3wiki-uid-link\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:365521bd-e2bd-4eea-b19a-9d599e0e855d\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=uuid:365521bd-e2bd-4eea-b19a-9d599e0e855d\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span>):</dd></dl>\n<p><br>\nGreetings.\n</p><p><br>\nWhat a cruelty, that I be reunited with my only son, only for him to be slaughtered. Have my sins against Wyll been so horrid that I must lose him just as I celebrated the man he'd become? Is this the fate I sealed seven long years ago when I cast him away?\n</p><p><br>\nIt wasn't so long ago that I suffered the heat of the <a href=\"/wiki/Avernus\" title=\"Avernus\">Hells</a> and the wrath of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baphomet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"The Horned King\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baphomet\">The Horned King</a></span>. But I have never known pain like this, the anguish of the black void appearing where my heart once beat.\n</p><p><br>\nI'm leaving. If the parasite takes me, so be it. Better to be a <a href=\"/wiki/Mind_flayer\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mind flayer\">mind flayer</a> than a mere shadow in duke's clothing.\n</p><p><br>\nUlder Ravengard, Grand Duke of Baldur's Gate\n</p>\n</div> <h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li>The title <i>\"The Horned King\"</i> is only used in combination with <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baphomet\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Baphomet\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Baphomet\">Baphomet</a></span> in D&amp;D sources, and he is not an inhabitant of the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hells\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hells\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Hells\">Hells</a></span> but the <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Abyss\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Abyss\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Abyss\">Abyss</a></span>. However he made an appeareance in <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Descent_into_Avernus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Descent into Avernus\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Descent_into_Avernus\">Descent into Avernus</a></span>, in which the city of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elturel\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/33px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/44px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Elturel\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png/22px-FRWiki_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"22\" height=\"22\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/6/68/FRWiki_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-extlink\"><a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://forgottenrealms.fandom.com/wiki/Elturel\">Elturel</a></span> with all of its inhabitants and Duke Ravengard where dragged temporarily into the hells.</li></ul>\n</div>   \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714214015\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.089 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.093 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3892/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 85841/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 29938/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 29/200\nExpensive parser function count: 3/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 0/1000\nLua time usage: 0.019/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1188922/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   72.309      1 Template:MiscItemPage\n100.00%   72.309      1 -total\n 57.53%   41.602     16 Template:Icon_text\n 50.77%   36.710     41 Template:Trim\n 29.32%   21.198      8 Template:Uid\n 24.71%   17.865     10 Template:Icon_link\n 14.68%   10.618      6 Template:FRWiki\n 11.29%    8.165      8 Template:Template_style\n 10.89%    7.876     16 Template:Ifempty\n 10.54%    7.618      4 Template:Uuid\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key bg3wiki:pcache:idhash:53421-0!canonical and tim